  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed installation of two externally illuminated banner signs because of their position, size, design, appearance would be an intrusive display, out of scale and character and appearance of the building and surrounding area and add excessive clutter to the street, adversely impact on the skyline. In addition, the structure due its depth and being visible, would block the windows, resulting loss of light and outlook to the flats in the building. Thus will be contrary to policies D4, D8 of London Plan, Local Plan policies CC1, CC2 and CC5.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed installation of two externally illuminated banner signs due to their size, location and visibility and their potential to distract drivers and divert attention would have a harmful effect on highway safety. In addition, lack of information on the; 1) frequency of change of the banners, 2) the method employed to do so, 3) details of the equipment to be used, would lead to an unsatisfactory development and prejudice safe functioning of the public highway contrary to London Plan policies T1, T2, T3, T4 and Local Plan policies EC1 and EC2."
  ],
